<%- include('partials/header') %>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container prose">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="prose-meta">Last updated: April 2025</p>

    <h2>1. Who We Are</h2>
    <p>
      Dark Triad Detector is an educational and entertainment project hosted at
      <a href="<%= siteUrl %>"><%= siteUrl %></a>. It is not affiliated with any clinical,
      medical, or governmental organisation.
    </p>

    <h2>2. What Data We Collect</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>The <strong>nickname</strong> you enter before taking the quiz (not a real name).</li>
      <li>Your <strong>questionnaire answers</strong> (numerical ratings 1–5 for 27 items).</li>
      <li>The <strong>AI-generated report</strong> produced from those answers.</li>
      <li>A <strong>session identifier</strong> stored in a browser cookie to link your answers to your result.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>3. How We Use It</h2>
    <p>
      Data is used solely to generate and display your personalised result during your session.
      Aggregate, anonymised data may be used to improve the model. We do not sell your data to
      third parties.
    </p>

    <h2>4. Cookies</h2>
    <p>
      We use a single <code>session</code> cookie (HTTP-only, secure) to maintain your session.
      No advertising or tracking cookies are used.
    </p>

    <h2>5. Data Retention</h2>
    <p>
      Session data expires after 24 hours. Result records may be retained in our database
      indefinitely in anonymised form for research purposes. You may request deletion of any
      personally identifiable record by contacting us at the address below.
    </p>

    <h2>6. Third-Party Services</h2>
    <p>
      The site calls an AI inference API (Groq / Llama) to generate your report. Only your
      anonymised questionnaire scores are sent; your nickname is never transmitted to third
      parties.
    </p>

    <h2>7. Your Rights</h2>
    <p>
      You have the right to access, correct, or delete any personal data we hold about you.
      Contact us at <a href="mailto:privacy@slmgx.edu.lk">privacy@slmgx.edu.lk</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>8. Changes</h2>
    <p>We may update this policy. Continued use of the site after changes constitutes acceptance.</p>

    <p><a href="/" class="btn btn--ghost">← Back Home</a></p>
  </div>
</section>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
